OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings for snow, gales and heavy
OL,4,Arain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree yellow weather warnings have been
OL,7,Fissued for the Isle of Man as heavy
OL,8,Frain, strong winds and snow are
OL,9,Fforecast.
OL,11,FRonaldsway Met Office said snow was
OL,12,Fexpected on higher ground above 1,000ft
OL,13,F(305m) overnight.
OL,15,FDrivers have been advised to avoid
OL,16,Fhigher roads between midnight and 06:00
OL,17,Fbecause of the risk of snow and ice.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
