OL,3,GNEWSAWarnings for snow, gales and heavy
OL,4,Arain
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe west of the island, stretching from
OL,7,FBallaugh to Dalby, is expected to bear
OL,8,Fthe brunt of the conditions, with gusts
OL,9,Fof up to 60mph (97km/h) and the
OL,10,Fheaviest downpours forecast.
OL,11,FCronk-y-Voddy is forecast to be the
OL,12,Fmost at risk from gales.
